Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Alone in this house, I have watched the seasons slip past...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.55,0:00:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,until this flower finally blossomed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How I've longed to see your beautifully clear eyes and hear your tender voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.90,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I have always known.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.61,0:01:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have always known that a magnificent flower would blossom here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.58,0:01:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Hikaru... Master Genji...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,When will you visit next?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Three months have passed since our last meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please return within the month this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.72,0:01:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, ten days... five days... or even tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, I forget myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.90,0:01:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You have many lovers in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.06,0:01:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I have made such an unseemly request.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall return forthwith. As soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.74,0:01:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be remiss of me to let another pluck such a radiant flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.24,0:01:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Koremitsu. Koremitsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here. How may I be of service?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.59,0:01:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a gift to that lady. More splendid than the usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.55,0:01:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:02:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what tomorrow may bring?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not know when I shall next visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.27,0:02:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\c&H3737FF&}Episode 1{\c}\N{\c&H46FFE2&}Master Hikaru{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.55,0:02:32.89,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't have a concept prepared for today either{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.55,0:02:32.89,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}kyou mo konseputo nanka moukenai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.01,0:02:38.35,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter what happens, I won't run away{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.01,0:02:38.35,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}donna hapuningu datte kawasanai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.69,0:02:39.98,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Talent{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.69,0:02:39.98,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}sainou
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.48,0:02:42.65,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Skill{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.48,0:02:42.65,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}yuunou
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.69,0:02:45.32,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My brain's pleasure center{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.69,0:02:45.32,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}gouyuudainou
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:48.28,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My senses{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:48.28,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}kannou
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:55.58,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go to the front lines! Your signal is clear{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:55.58,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ike saizensen! anata no aizu kaimei
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.66,0:03:00.08,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm at an age where I want to choose my own vague sympathies{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.66,0:03:00.08,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}aimai mimai erabitai toshigoro
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:05.13,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Give me more difficult topics{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:05.13,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}motto nandai wo watashi ni dashite
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.29,0:03:06.42,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well done!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.55,0:03:11.05,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I only prefer colors that I can taste right now{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.55,0:03:11.05,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}tatta ima shika ajiwaenai iro ga ii no
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.22,0:03:16.22,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tell me about this moment as much as you can{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.22,0:03:16.22,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ima no saidagen wo kikasete!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.31,0:03:17.35,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well done!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.47,0:03:21.73,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lets meet up so we can use up the present{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.47,0:03:21.73,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}tatta ima tsukaihatasu tame no aouyo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:24.73,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.23,0:03:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I say, if it isn't Master Hikaru...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.69,0:03:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out for a stroll admiring the peak of the cherry blossom season?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Yes, I suppose I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The cherry blossoms of the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps I should call it the crowning point of spring...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.98,0:03:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Some trees covered in splendor; others stripped by the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.66,0:03:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They truly are myriad, are they not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.29,0:04:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.00,0:04:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And which do you prefer, Master Hikaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse my impertinence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.53,0:04:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if the idle gossip among the ladies of the Imperial Court is to be believed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you certainly have an impressive reputation as a man who has stripped a few boughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a fine one to talk, Lord Tou no Chuujou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard similar rumors about you from the ladies-in-waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,About me, you say? What on Earth could you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.85,0:04:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That wherever Lord Chuujou treads, even a tree that is wilting shall burst into full bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.56,0:04:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah? Surely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.78,0:04:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say that the spring air invites the people to gossip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.84,0:04:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us leave it at that, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is his story, the one called Master Genji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He, whose story has been told and retold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ephemeral romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumultuous passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.56,0:05:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Each tale must be told in turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,For in each and every tale is a testament to the love in his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He was very young when he experienced his first love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.39,0:05:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Snow flurries were dancing in the wind on a winter morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,A quiet pond, rarely visited, away from the Imperial Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.01,0:06:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,As a child, Lord Hikaru favored this place to savor his solitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.27,0:06:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.01,0:06:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.75,0:06:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who... are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess? Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.69,0:06:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:07:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was that beautiful woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.05,0:07:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That was how it all began.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.27,0:07:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The nine-year-old Lord Hikaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.23,0:07:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fourteen-year-old Fujitsubo of the Wisteria Pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.74,0:07:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Young master. How may we assist you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.21,0:07:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I require nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.71,0:07:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Hikaru, are you in search of someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.95,0:07:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Hikaru was the Emperor's second son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.27,0:07:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,His mother, of whom he had no memory, was Kiritsubo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Lady of the Paulownia Pavilion, who was not long for this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:08:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Emperor adored her more than anyone; she was a woman said to be transcendently beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.62,0:08:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Her story is told even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For that reason, the Emperor was fond of Master Hikaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, he gave him the surname Genji, and made him a high retainer in the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs11}Note: By giving Genji a last name, the Emperor is making him a commoner, removing him from the imperial line of succession.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Emperor were to pass away, Genji would undoubtedly become a pawn...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,in the court's political infighting to name a successor to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.08,0:08:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said that the Emperor's desire...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.53,0:08:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,to spare Lord Hikaru of that cruel fate compelled him to name the boy a commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Hikaru? Young master?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.33,0:08:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you standing by the pond again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.06,0:08:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I searched everywhere for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Your formal court garb.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:09:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father... the Emperor wishes to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.78,0:09:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems as though there is someone he wishes to make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.90,0:09:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to meet anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't do, saying such selfish things. You mustn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Hikaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.57,0:09:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter, Hikaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Lady Fujitsubo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it! It's her! I've finally found her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,From this day forward, she will be my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.01,0:09:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, I would like you to think of her as your new mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:09:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're Master Hikaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I am delighted to meet you, Master Hikaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.01,0:10:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like illustrated stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.23,0:10:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.40,0:10:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have brought a number of scrolls with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And look at this one too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard this one before! It's about a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.66,0:10:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a horrifying face, but underneath, he has a compassionate heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Emperor appears to be in fine spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.84,0:10:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How truly fortunate he met Lady Fujitsubo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It was destined to be - she is the very image of Master Hikaru's mother, Lady Kiritsubo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:11:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true. When they play together, it is akin to watching a mother with her child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all. Fujitsubo is yet young; he is more like a younger brother to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.35,0:11:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Spring?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.95,0:11:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,At this time every year, I begin to look forward to spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.76,0:11:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Spring...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.91,0:11:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Spring is so joyous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Blooming plum blossoms, the scent of peach blossoms,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and rows of cherry blossoms everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.17,0:11:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything becomes so bright and lustrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that this is my home, it's strange to think that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.30,0:11:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I will miss the moment spring comes to my own garden this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you miss it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.46,0:11:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Your home?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.35,0:11:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You do, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.11,0:11:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.53,0:11:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Emperor is so kind and you have also welcomed me into your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.31,0:12:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, why am I crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Something must be the matter with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.91,0:12:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I am fine. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.47,0:12:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts... It hurts sometimes, but I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Hikaru? Young master?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.49,0:12:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's frightfully cold tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please retire to your chamber and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.56,0:12:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Hikaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.95,0:12:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry. I shall wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.28,0:12:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there. Spring is about to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.34,0:12:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to witness its arrival with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.57,0:12:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see the way spring adorns that branch so that I can tell her about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.49,0:13:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.06,0:13:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Whom do you wish to tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.02,0:13:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it Lady Fujitsubo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Hikaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Spring is so late this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.89,0:14:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Hikaru has fallen in the pond!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.74,0:14:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He has fallen while gathering flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.11,0:14:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.95,0:14:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I dropped the first flowers of spring in the pond.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.75,0:14:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You wished to gather them for me, did you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.37,0:14:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But please do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.29,0:14:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In future, please refrain from placing yourself in harm's way for my sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I will grow bigger... and stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.12,0:14:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then shall I be able to grant you anything you desire. I shall be able to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.47,0:15:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, kind Master Hikaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.78,0:15:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,When you are older, I know that you will become a magnificent gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my, Master Hikaru! What beautiful handwriting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The Emperor is always boasting about his son's masterful brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.85,0:15:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, he doesn't leave out your excellent horsemanship and archery, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a dream this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.66,0:15:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same dream as always, but this time, there were differences.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I dreamed of my mother's passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother, Lady Kiritsubo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. However, this morning, her face looked just like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.12,0:16:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.79,0:16:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate sent me to replace your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This dream must be proof of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I am like an older sister to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.98,0:16:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and you are my younger brother and child.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.52,0:16:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that not poignant?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.82,0:17:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not my mother, nor my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.21,0:17:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You are... you are my...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, the springs came and went.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.92,0:17:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,As time passed, that moment remained a secret; not a soul knew of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Hikaru matured and grew ever more handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There were ladies in the court who wrote love letters praising his beauty, while others wrote poems.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.12,0:17:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, Master Hikaru would always visit one place over all others:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Fujitsubo's pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.89,0:17:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He spent his days flitting back and forth to visit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.67,0:18:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have brought you a handful of wisteria blossoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.31,0:18:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that you are suffering from a cold. I thought these might lift your spirits, Lady Fujitsubo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please leave them there. I would not wish to spread my illness to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.00,0:18:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you please allow me to rest today?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.95,0:18:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. I only came to deliver the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.97,0:18:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.07,0:18:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall perhaps meet with you tomorrow, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.98,0:18:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the correct path. This is how it must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.97,0:18:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I must distance myself from him, little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It is unthinkable... I want him to understand that these feelings are unthinkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.83,0:18:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong... I must be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.15,0:18:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If I endure,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:19:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,he shall forget all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.70,0:19:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hikaru turned twelve...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and came of age.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.31,0:19:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming of age means to be recognized by the world as an adult for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.13,0:19:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,At the same time, it marked the day that Lady Fujitsubo had long awaited.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.53,0:19:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A day that had finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.14,0:19:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The strict decorum of the Imperial Court stated...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.55,0:19:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,that a mature adult was subject to the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,as was his correspondence with the ladies and ladies-in-waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.19,0:19:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He would not be permitted to even set foot in the same chamber as her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.36,0:20:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I implore you... please lift your blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.57,0:20:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see your face one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.22,0:20:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I bid you farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.71,0:20:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Master Genji...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.76,0:20:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I have oft noticed a peculiar look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,As though you are gazing at something far off, yet not seeing anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.35,0:20:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... those eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.27,0:20:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,As though you're wholly adrift in an unrequited love too intense to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.79,0:20:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this another of your deductions?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.83,0:20:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.06,0:20:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How could any fair maiden possibly resist the charms of the greatest lover to ever walk the Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Truthfully, Master Hikaru's heart still cherished the love that blossomed on that secret day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.11,0:21:28.24,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wish you would have turned around at least once{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.11,0:21:28.24,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}semete ichido kurai furimuite hoshikatta
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.83,0:21:41.96,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wish I could have stayed by your side like the wind{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.83,0:21:41.96,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}semete kaze no you ni tada soba ni utakatta
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.67,0:21:48.89,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I locked away my feelings for you{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.67,0:21:48.89,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ichizuma omoi ni kagi wo kake
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.72,0:22:02.44,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But, even to this day, my imprisoned heart still smells sweet{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.72,0:22:02.44,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}tojikometa kokoro wa, ima mo mada amaku kaoru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.53,0:22:16.00,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I always had my gaze upon only you{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.53,0:22:16.00,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}anato wo anata dake wo itsu demo muteimashita
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:33.23,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This unrequited love was like a flower that can never bloom{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:33.23,Songs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}sakanai tsubomi no you ni mukuwarenai koi deshita
